      "content": "Here is a template for a standard professional response: \"Thank you for reaching out to us about your order's shipping status. I understand delays can be frustrating, and I apologize for any inconvenience this may be causing. Please allow me a moment to look up the latest tracking information for you.\" This approach is polite, acknowledges the customer's concern directly, and sets clear expectations for the next step. Always ensure the tracking number or direct next action is provided promptly after this introductory message.",
