      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For an urban-friendly vibe, try something more direct and relatable. \"Hey there! Saw you were checking on your order, and sorry about the shipping hiccup—things are moving a little slower than planned right now. I'm pulling up the latest details on your package for you to get that status sorted out ASAP.\" This uses more casual language, sounds more approachable, and focuses on a quick resolution. It maintains professionalism while dropping the corporate jargon.",
      "source": "target",
